# Kellner (M7, D-105): a Viennese coffee-house waiter, forever busy.
# Black waistcoat d with a white shirt front and a small d bow tie, white
# shirt sleeves w/i, a long white apron w/i to his shins, black trousers d,
# shoes l, dark hair l with a neat n side parting.
# Prop: a silver tray w/i/m held flat over his head on his raised back hand;
# its top line is sprite row 6 = the hitbox top (the bounce surface). On it a
# Melange cup w with an O crema dot and a glass of water s/h (rows 1-5).
# walk: brisk short steps under the apron, the tray never moves.
# bounce: the tray dipped 2 px, knees bent, an annoyed brow ("Komm' gleich!").
# squished: sits on the floor, the tray on his head, the cups intact.
# Faces right; mirror = auto. Built with a scratch script (layers + automatic
# k outline), frozen to text here.
sprite = kellner
size   = 16x32
origin = 8,32
hitbox = 2,6,12,26
mirror = auto
anim   = walk     frames=4 ticks=6 loop
anim   = bounce   frames=1
anim   = squished frames=1
